{"synopsis":"Sepuluh tahun lalu, ia melarikan diri dari pernikahan yang tak pernah diinginkannya—bahkan di malam pertama mereka. Demi kebebasan, ia meninggalkan nama, keluarga, dan seorang istri yang nyaris tak dikenalnya. Namun ketika kabar duka memaksanya pulang setelah satu dekade pengasingan, ia menemukan sesuatu yang tak pernah ia bayangkan: sang istri masih ada di sana. Tetap menunggu. Tetap setia. Dan tetap secantik wanita yang ia tinggalkan bertahun-tahun lalu. Kini, di antara penyesalan, rahasia masa lalu, dan perasaan yang belum sempat tumbuh, ia harus menghadapi satu pertanyaan: mengapa wanita itu masih bertahan setelah sepuluh tahun ditinggalkan?","alternative_title":"부인은 밀밭에서 기다렸다","author":"papapa","artist":"Studio Wooridle","chapters":[{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"095941a6-bcd5-4369-bbe5-b3e70679df61","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-07-27"},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"6ca97af2-40a3-419b-8d15-977b07c95e1d","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-07-20"},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"ee6d588a-6365-44f8-9e98-085a468a876a","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-07-13"},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"ce2b5682-0db5-4593-8ced-dfbab20ae1b0","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-07-07"},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"dde049bb-06ed-488d-8353-6aa5d658e419","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-06-30"},{"number":"17","chapter":"17","slug":"136eda37-9650-49c9-9f57-04fe9d26e9e7","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-06-23"},{"number":"16","chapter":"16","slug":"63995efc-7ff7-4ef1-9f0b-06a71409bf77","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-06-17"},{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"3de1a148-9475-4faa-a286-0d2a44a558b4","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-06-09"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"66d406db-959b-4e9c-b11f-cc263c01eda3","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-06-09"},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"283cd424-2232-421d-8521-e637abeadbbd","title":"Chapter 13","date":"2026-06-09"},{"number":"12","chapter":"12","slug":"be6d0ca8-5a96-4646-8a